# Binary files git ekata commit karanne nae - GitHub "Releases" ekata
# upload karanna (Release assets). Hethuwa:
#   - .deb eka 36 MB. git ekata dammoth hama clone ekakatama eka enawa,
#     saha history eken kawadawath ain wenne nae.
#   - Releases eken download count penawa, saha version ekak ekak wenama
#     thiyaganna puluwan.
*.deb
*.exe
*.zip
notes.md
site.json

# PDF eka: podi (2 MB) nisa repo ekata dammath kamak nae. Release asset ekak
# widihata one nam, pahala line eke # eka ain karanna.
*.pdf
